@startuml Sequence Register
!theme plain

actor User
participant Frontend
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
database "Auth DB" as DB

User -> Frontend: Заполняет форму регистрации
Frontend -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/auth/register\n{email, password, firstName, lastName}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Gateway: Проверка публичного эндпоинта
Gateway -> Auth: POST /api/v1/auth/register
activate Auth
Auth -> Auth: Валидация данных
Auth -> DB: Проверка существования email
activate DB
DB --> Auth: Результат проверки
deactivate DB
Auth -> Auth: Хеширование пароля (bcrypt)
Auth -> DB: INSERT INTO users
activate DB
DB --> Auth: Созданный пользователь
deactivate DB
Auth -> Auth: Генерация JWT токена
Auth --> Gateway: 201 Created\n{token, user}
deactivate Auth
Gateway --> Frontend: 201 Created\n{token, user}
deactivate Gateway
Frontend -> Frontend: Сохранение токена в localStorage
Frontend --> User: Редирект на Dashboard

@enduml

